CTW GEIGER SCOPE — System Architecture & Technical Specification

Classification: Radiation Telemetry Forensic Console
Revision: 1.0
Status: Active Development

1. System Identity

CTW Geiger Scope is not a Geiger counter display. It is a radiation event telemetry and forensic analysis system — a software architecture that treats radiation detector output as a structured signal stream subject to acquisition, conditioning, event reconstruction, temporal analysis, anomaly classification, and evidentiary logging.

The attached detector (FS-5000 via RadPro firmware, or any CPS/DR-streaming source) is an input transducer. The system begins where the transducer ends.

